@host = http://localhost:5084

### List notes. Initially: 200 OK and []
GET {{host}}/api/notes

### Create. 201 Created, Location header and the assigned ID
POST {{host}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Read chapter 28"}

### Read. Replace 1 with the ID returned by POST
GET {{host}}/api/notes/1

### Update. 204 No Content
PUT {{host}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Finish the assignment"}

### Reject blank input. 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"   "}

### Process text. This does not save a note
POST {{host}}/api/text/uppercase
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"hello"}

### Remove surrounding whitespace. This does not save a note
POST {{host}}/api/text/trim
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"  hello  "}

### Stop the server, restart it, then run GET again before deleting
GET {{host}}/api/notes

### Delete. 204 No Content, then 404 if repeated
DELETE {{host}}/api/notes/1
